1
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:08,730
Every day, people in Bangladesh get fake bKash and Nagad messages,

2
00:00:08,730 --> 00:00:12,536
OTP requests, and job offers that are too good to be true.

3
00:00:12,536 --> 00:00:15,685
One wrong reply can wipe out a family's savings.

4
00:00:15,685 --> 00:00:22,377
ScamShield BD is a free AI web app that helps everyday people spot these scams before they lose money,

5
00:00:22,377 --> 00:00:24,542
and recover if they already have.

6
00:00:24,542 --> 00:00:28,741
It's built for the Ostad presents YUNet AIgnite Buildathon 2026,

7
00:00:28,741 --> 00:00:32,350
and the official sticker sits right here in the navbar.

8
00:00:33,151 --> 00:00:35,263
Let's check a suspicious message.

9
00:00:35,263 --> 00:00:39,616
I'll load a classic fake wrong-send SMS and add the sender's number.

10
00:00:39,616 --> 00:00:42,881
You can also upload a screenshot instead of typing.

11
00:00:47,076 --> 00:00:51,089
It returns a clear verdict with a risk score, the exact red flags,

12
00:00:51,089 --> 00:00:54,372
what the scammer is really after, and what to do next.

13
00:00:54,372 --> 00:00:58,446
There's even a ready-made warning to share with family on WhatsApp.

14
00:01:01,026 --> 00:01:04,407
If the sender looks like a scammer, one tap reports the number,

15
00:01:04,407 --> 00:01:07,466
so the community can see how many people have flagged it.

16
00:01:08,267 --> 00:01:11,543
With one tap, it explains the result in simple Bangla,

17
00:01:11,543 --> 00:01:14,577
so parents and grandparents can understand it too.

18
00:01:15,380 --> 00:01:19,014
Still not sure? Ask a follow-up question about the result,

19
00:01:19,014 --> 00:01:22,710
right on the same page. And if the AI service is ever busy,

20
00:01:22,710 --> 00:01:25,717
ScamShield falls back to built-in scam patterns,

21
00:01:25,717 --> 00:01:28,160
so you're never left without an answer.

22
00:01:31,916 --> 00:01:36,812
The practice game uses AI to create realistic messages. You decide: scam,

23
00:01:36,812 --> 00:01:40,233
or genuine? Every answer teaches you the red flags,

24
00:01:40,233 --> 00:01:44,056
so you build the habit before a real scammer reaches you.

25
00:01:49,047 --> 00:01:52,314
If you've already replied to a scammer, open Get Help.

26
00:01:52,314 --> 00:01:55,943
Describe what happened in your own words, or try an example.

27
00:01:55,943 --> 00:01:59,634
Say whether you sent money or shared a PIN, when it happened,

28
00:01:59,634 --> 00:02:01,267
and how you were contacted.

29
00:02:05,786 --> 00:02:09,824
ScamShield builds a personal recovery plan: how urgent it is,

30
00:02:09,824 --> 00:02:13,663
the likely scam type, prioritised steps, who to report to,

31
00:02:13,663 --> 00:02:17,436
follow-up scams to watch for, and advice for your family.

32
00:02:18,239 --> 00:02:20,682
You can then ask follow-up questions.

33
00:02:20,682 --> 00:02:24,644
The answers are grounded in your own incident and your plan,

34
00:02:24,644 --> 00:02:25,899
not generic advice.

35
00:02:31,508 --> 00:02:33,223
Need to talk it through?

36
00:02:33,223 --> 00:02:39,438
The live AI agent chat lets anyone discuss a suspicious message or a scam in real time,

37
00:02:39,438 --> 00:02:40,938
in English or Bangla.

38
00:02:42,238 --> 00:02:44,536
ScamShield is built for phones first.

39
00:02:44,536 --> 00:02:47,145
It has a dark mode for night-time reading,

40
00:02:47,145 --> 00:02:51,368
and it can be installed like an app, so help is always one tap away.

41
00:02:53,562 --> 00:02:57,539
Every check is saved in History, only on your own device.

42
00:02:57,539 --> 00:03:02,562
And the whole app works in Bangla, on mobile and desktop. ScamShield BD.

43
00:03:02,562 --> 00:03:04,934
Spot the scam before it costs you.

44
00:03:04,934 --> 00:03:08,562
Try it now at scamshield dot najmunnaharhira dot me.
